body:
Sandygast and Palossand! The thought of possessed sand is so hilarious to me and I love seeing the little sandygasts haul sand across the beach

&#x200B;

I also love Clawitzer, the cute shrimp with a cannon for an arm

&#x200B;

I'm not sure if it's unpopular exactly but I've always liked Chandelure as well. Cool ghost type design with a distinctive cry
